#: core/classes/class.bookingpress_payment_gateways.php:458
msgid ""
"Dear %customer_first_name% %customer_last_name%,<br/><br/>This is regarding "
"your recent payment and appointment scheduling with the below details which "
"is not successfully booked, despite your payment being processed due to "
"unforeseen technical glitches.<br/><br/>%service_name% - "
"%appointment_date_time% - %appointment_amount%<br/><br/>We will process the "
"refund for the full amount of your payment and it will be credited back to "
"your account within the next 4-7 business days. We truly regret any "
"inconvenience this may have caused you and understand the importance of "
"having a smooth and hassle-free experience with our services.<br/><br/>Best "
"regards,<br/>%company_name%<br/>%company_address%<br/>%company_phone%<br/>"
"%company_website%"
msgstr ""
"Estimado %customer_first_name% %customer_last_name%,<br/><br/>Se trata de su "
"pago reciente y la programación de citas con los detalles a continuación que "
"no se reservaron correctamente, a pesar de que su pago se procesó debido a "
"fallas técnicas imprevistas.<br/><br/>%service_name% - "
"%appointment_date_time% - %appointment_amount%<br/><br/>Procesaremos el "
"reembolso por el monto total de su pago y se acreditará nuevamente a su "
"cuenta dentro de los próximos 4 a 7 días hábiles. Realmente lamentamos "
"cualquier inconveniente que esto pueda haberle causado y entendemos la "
"importancia de tener una experiencia fluida y sin complicaciones con "
"nuestros servicios.<br/><br/>Atentamente,,<br/>%company_name%<br/>"
"%company_address%<br/>%company_phone%<br/>%company_website%"

#: core/classes/class.bookingpress_payment_gateways.php:497
msgid ""
"Dear Administrator,<br/>One of the recently booked appointment has conflict "
"with another appointment with booking ID - %bookingpress_appointment_id% on "
"our booking platform. So, an immediate action is required to handle the "
"refund process for their payment.<br/><br/>Below are the appointment and "
"payment details for your reference:<br/>Appointment Date: "
"%appointment_date%<br/>Appointment Time: %appointment_time%<br/>Payment ID: "
"%transaction_id%<br/>Payment Amount: %appointment_amount%<br/>Payment "
"Gateway:%bookingpress_payment_gateway%<br/>First name & Last name: "
"%customer_first_name% %customer_last_name%,<br/>Customer Full Name: "
"%customer_full_name%<br/>Customer Email: %customer_email%<br/>Customer Phone:"
" %customer_phone%<br/><br/>Best regards,<br/>%company_name%<br/>"
"%company_address%<br/>%company_phone%<br/>%company_website%"
msgstr ""
"Estimado administrador,<br/>Una de las citas reservadas recientemente tiene "
"un conflicto con otra cita con ID de reserva: %bookingpress_appointment_id% "
"en nuestra plataforma de reservas. Por lo tanto, se requiere una acción "
"inmediata para manejar el proceso de reembolso de su pago.<br/><br/>A "
"continuación se muestran los detalles de la cita y el pago para su "
"referencia:<br/>Día de la cita: %appointment_date%<br/>Hora de la cita: "
"%appointment_time%<br/>Identificación de pago: %transaction_id%<br/>Monto "
"del pago: %appointment_amount%<br/>Pasarela de pago: "
"%bookingpress_payment_gateway%<br/>Nombre Apellido: %customer_first_name% "
"%customer_last_name%,<br/>Nombre completo del cliente: "
"%customer_full_name%<br/>Correo electrónico del cliente: "
"%customer_email%<br/>Teléfono del cliente: %customer_phone%<br/><br/>"
"Atentamente,<br/>%company_name%<br/>%company_address%<br/>"
"%company_phone%<br/>%company_website%"

